  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif hwilc preost agilte 7 he ofer biscopes gebod mæssige, gilde for ðam gebode XX ór, 7 þar to eacan þone gilt gebete, ðe hit ær geworhte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if any priest commits an offence and he celebates mass in spite of the bishop's prohibition, he is to pay 20 ores for disregard of the prohibition, and in addition make amends for the offence which he previously committed.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And if any priest sins and he holds mass in spite of the bishop's command, he is to pay twenty ores for neglecting that command, and also do penance for the wrong which he committed previously.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
